<div class="content">
    <h1>Account Deletion Confirmation</h1>

    <p>Hello {{name}},</p>

    <p>
        We're sorry to see you go. This email confirms that your Orgatick account has been successfully deleted as
        per your request.
    </p>

    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%"
        style="margin: 20px 0; background-color: #f0f7ff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px;">
        <tr>
            <td>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #1f2937; margin: 0 0 12px 0;">
                    <strong>What has been deleted:</strong>
                </p>
                <ul style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li style="margin: 6px 0;">Your personal information and profile</li>
                    <li style="margin: 6px 0;">Event registration history</li>
                    <li style="margin: 6px 0;">Saved preferences and settings</li>
                    <li style="margin: 6px 0;">All associated account data</li>
                </ul>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%"
        style="margin: 20px 0; background-color: #fef3c7; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 16px;">
        <tr>
            <td>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #92400e; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">
                    <strong>Important:</strong>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #92400e; margin: 0;">
                    This action is permanent and cannot be undone. If you have any active event registrations or
                    tickets, please note that they may no longer be accessible.
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <p>
        You will no longer receive any communications from Orgatick, except for this final confirmation email.
    </p>

    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%"
        style="margin: 20px 0; background-color: #fee2e2; border-left: 4px solid #dc2626; padding: 16px;">
        <tr>
            <td>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #991b1b; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">
                    <strong>Deleted by mistake?</strong>
                </p>
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #991b1b; margin: 0;">
                    If you did not request this deletion, please contact our support team immediately at
                    <a href="mailto:contact@orgatick.com"
                        style="color: #dc2626; text-decoration: none;">contact@orgatick.com</a>
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <p>
        We appreciate the time you spent with us. If you'd like to share feedback about your experience or the
        reason for leaving, we'd love to hear from you.
    </p>

    <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #4b5563; margin-top: 30px;">
        You're always welcome back. If you change your mind, you can create a new account at any time.
    </p>

    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <tr>
            <td align="">
                <p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #4b5563; margin: 0;">
                    Thank you for being part of our community.<br />
                    <strong style="color: #1f2937;">- Orgatick Team</strong>
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</div>
